  "messages": {
    "CERTIFICATE_WAIVED_NON_ISSUING_AUTHORITY": "benchmark verdict='PASS' ∧ rubric_authority='explore' — 벤치 스킬은 이 판정에 인증서를 발행하지 않는다(자동 발행 = explicit ∧ PASS). 요구 증거는 bench_report 이며 그 판정 표가 같은 verdict·권한을 말한다(교차검증 일치 · state=parsed)",
    "CERTIFICATE_WAIVED_RUBRIC_CONTRACT_UNMET": "benchmark.verdict='PASS' ∧ rubric_authority='explore' → 인증서 면제. 그러나 manifest rubric 계약이 서지 않는다(carrier='manifest_benchmark', floor_tps=-1.0, ratio=None) — 승격을 열지 않는다",
    "MANIFEST_RUBRIC_FLOOR_INVALID": "benchmark.floor_tps=-1 is not a finite positive number -- floor<=0 means the rubric imposed NO threshold (공허 PASS): every measurement passes. Not promotable in ANY authority.",
    "MANIFEST_RUBRIC_RATIO_MISSING": "benchmark.ratio_M_over_primary=None is not a finite number -- the measurement-vs-rubric indicator is absent, so the verdict cannot be audited",
    "MANIFEST_RUBRIC_SOURCE_MISSING": "benchmark.primary_source=None is absent -- which rubric slot won cannot be established (surfaced, never matched as a string: the numeric floor/ratio contract above is the gate)"
  },
